Alternative stack-based solution (cancel any adjacent opposite pair):

```python
def minLengthAfterRemovals(s: str) -> int:
    stack = []
    for ch in s:
        if stack and stack[-1] != ch:
            stack.pop()
        else:
            stack.append(ch)
    return len(stack)
```
